PN,30501
SC,0001
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FA woman with advanced ovarian cancer
OL,7,Fhas become the first patient in the
OL,8,Fworld to receive a pioneering new
OL,9,Ftherapy.
OL,11,FTracy Tomlinson, 58, was given the
OL,12,Fdrug at the Christie NHS Foundation
OL,13,FTrust in Manchester as part of a
OL,14,Fclinical trial evaluating a new type
OL,15,Fof treatment for several types of
OL,16,Fcancer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FThe therapy, known as ZI-MA4-1, will
OL,7,Fbe tested on people with ovarian
OL,8,Fcancer, lung cancer, sarcomas and head
OL,9,Fand neck cancer in a trial led by the
OL,10,FChristie, with a site also at the
OL,11,FRoyal Marsden in London.
OL,13,FMany people in the study have few
OL,14,Fother options for survival.
OL,16,FMrs Tomlinson, from Chadderton in
OL,17,FGreater Manchester, has already beaten
OL,18,Fthe odds in staying alive, having
OL,19,Fundergone surgery and several rounds
OL,20,Fof chemotherapy since she was
OL,21,Fdiagnosed in 2020.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FThe new therapy works by combining two
OL,7,Fpowerful methods in fighting cancer.
OL,9,FFirstly, it harnesses the body's
OL,10,Fnatural killer (NK) cells, which are
OL,11,Fspecialist immune cells that destroy
OL,12,Fabnormal ones.
OL,14,FSecondly, T-cell receptors (TCRs) on
OL,15,Fthe cells are engineered to recognise
OL,16,Fand target tumours producing a protein
OL,17,Fcalled Mage-A4.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FMage-A4 is found in several types of
OL,7,Fcancer and experts believe it is an
OL,8,Fideal target for attacking abnormal
OL,9,Fcells.
OL,11,FUnlike some personalised treatments,
OL,12,FZI-MA4-1 is designed as an "off-the-
OL,13,Fshelf" therapy that uses immune cells
OL,14,Ffrom donors.
OL,16,FThe treatment is manufactured in
OL,17,Fadvance from donor cells rather than
OL,18,Fbeing individually tailored to each
OL,19,Fpatient, with hundreds of doses
OL,20,Fproduced from a single manufacturing
OL,21,Fbatch.
OL,26,@tD@\OUuD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FExperts believe this could mean
OL,7,Fadvanced cell therapies are available
OL,8,Fto more patients more quickly, and at
OL,9,Fa cheaper cost.
OL,11,FMrs Tomlinson was diagnosed with
OL,12,Fovarian cancer that had spread shortly
OL,13,Fbefore Christmas 2020 and immediately
OL,14,Funderwent treatment.
OL,16,FBy summer 2021, scans showed no
OL,17,Fevidence of disease but, a year later,
OL,18,Fthe cancer returned.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FDespite further rounds of treatment
OL,7,Fand 48 chemotherapy infusions, her
OL,8,Fcancer kept coming back.
OL,10,FThe former Civil Service manager told
OL,11,Fthe Press Association she was
OL,12,Fdiagnosed as stage 3C, which means
OL,13,Fthere were cancer growths spreading
OL,14,Finto the peritoneum of the body.
OL,16,FShe currently has a tumour between the
OL,17,Fliver and kidney as well as small
OL,18,Ftumours elsewhere.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FShe said: "They've got rid of the
OL,7,Fcancer twice but then it came back
OL,8,Fabout two and a half years ago, and
OL,9,Fwe've never seemed to get rid of it
OL,10,Fsince then.
OL,12,F"The chemotherapy has shrunk it but
OL,13,Fwhen treatment stops, it has come back.
OL,15,F"It is a lot to live with and there's
OL,16,Fbeen ups and downs ` there's been
OL,17,Felation, there's been disappointment,
OL,18,Fand bits in between.
OL,26,@nD@KOUtD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"But I try very, very hard to remain
OL,7,Fvery positive. Every day that I wake
OL,8,Fup is a positive. You've got to have
OL,9,Fhope."
OL,11,FMrs Tomlinson said in her working
OL,12,Flife, she was target driven and set
OL,13,Fherself very high standards.
OL,15,F"But you can't control cancer," she
OL,16,Fsaid. "What I can control is how I
OL,17,Flook at it, how I deal with it, and
OL,18,Ftrying to eat healthily and taking the
OL,19,Fpositives in everything.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@FO]wD@AOUwD@_O]xD@GOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"And I've learned to appreciate the
OL,7,Fsmallest of things that we take for
OL,8,Fgranted ` and the people around you
OL,9,Fand what they mean to you.
OL,11,F"Also, the beauty of outside and the
OL,12,Ftrees and the colour of the trees and
OL,13,Fthe birds singing.
OL,15,F"We just go from A to B, don't we?
OL,16,FBusy, busy, busy. But we never slow
OL,17,Fdown and take in the wonder of what's
OL,18,Faround us.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"I often think, 'I'm still here', and
OL,7,Fthat's helped me think, 'Why can't I
OL,8,Fstill be here in 10 years?', 'Why
OL,9,Fcan't I still be here in 15 years?'
OL,11,F"And I believe taking all the
OL,12,Ftreatments offered to me is helping me
OL,13,Fkick that can a bit further down the
OL,14,Froad.
OL,16,F"I don't want to go anywhere. I've
OL,17,Fstill got a lot of things I want to do
OL,18,Fand things I want to achieve."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOUzD@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FMrs Tomlinson said husband Paul, who
OL,7,Fshe married in 2022, is her "rock" and
OL,8,Fshe is also close to her son Harry, 28.
OL,10,FLast year, she was referred to the
OL,11,FChristie's early phase clinical trials
OL,12,Fteam for extensive screening, and
OL,13,Flearned she was a suitable candidate
OL,14,Ffor the Zima-101 clinical trial.
OL,16,F"I decided almost straight away that I
OL,17,Fwas going to go for it," she said.
OL,26,@oD@]OUoD@bO]xD@AOUyD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"Then afterwards you think, 'Am I
OL,7,Fdoing the right thing?', because it is
OL,8,Fa little bit scary being the first
OL,9,Fperson in the world to have the
OL,10,Ftreatment."
OL,12,FShe has had three infusions of the
OL,13,Ftherapy, with the option of another
OL,14,Fone depending on what scans show.
OL,16,F"If it benefits me, absolutely
OL,17,Ffantastic," she said. "But if it
OL,18,Fbenefits other people in the future,
OL,19,Fthat's important too.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@KO]xD@AOUyD@KO]yD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"I don't want to have gone through
OL,7,Feverything I've gone through for
OL,8,Fnothing. I want to feel like I have
OL,9,Fmade a difference."
OL,11,FProfessor Fiona Thistlethwaite,
OL,12,Fconsultant medical oncologist at the
OL,13,FChristie, said: "While this is an
OL,14,Fearly-stage study primarily focused on
OL,15,Fsafety, it represents an exciting step
OL,16,Fforward in efforts to develop new
OL,17,Ftreatment options for people like
OL,18,FTracy with advanced solid tumours.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@SO]uD@QOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"We hope the knowledge gained will
OL,7,Fhelp shape future cancer treatments
OL,8,Fand ultimately improve outcomes for
OL,9,Fpatients."
OL,11,FDr Jon Lim, consultant medical
OL,12,Foncologist in advanced immunotherapy
OL,13,Fand cell therapy at the Christie, told
OL,14,FPA: "What's very exciting about this
OL,15,Fis that these are essentially not kind
OL,16,Fof antibody-based, but living cells.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@JO]vD@EOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"These are live immune cells that are
OL,7,Finfused in hundreds of millions back
OL,8,Fto the patient, and the idea of this
OL,9,Fis that it is a little bit more
OL,10,Ftargeted.
OL,12,F"The reason this is very interesting
OL,13,Fis because this is the first of its
OL,14,Fkind globally in this approach, where
OL,15,Fit's taking donor immune cells,
OL,16,Fmanipulating or engineering them, and
OL,17,Fputting them into the recipient.
OL,19,F"Tracy is essentially getting somebody
OL,20,Felse's immune cells that have been
OL,21,Fengineered to 'see' her cancer.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"We're very excited. This is a novel
OL,7,Fapproach in the cell therapy space. We
OL,8,Fare also really showcasing what we can
OL,9,Fdo in the UK."
OL,11,FNamir Hassan, chief executive of
OL,12,FNorwegian firm Zelluna, which makes ZI-
OL,13,FMA4-1, said Mrs Tomlinson's first dose
OL,14,Fis a "landmark moment", adding: "It
OL,15,Frepresents the moment when years of
OL,16,Fresearch moved beyond the laboratory
OL,17,Fand into the clinic, offering a new
OL,18,Fpotential treatment option for
OL,19,Fpatients facing advanced cancers with
OL,20,Flimited alternatives."
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@NO]vD@FOUvD@VO]vD@aOU|D@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,FOnly around 15% of women survive
OL,7,Fovarian cancer for five years or more
OL,8,Fafter they are diagnosed.
OL,10,FDr Diana Hernandez, director of immune
OL,11,Fand advanced therapies at Anthony
OL,12,FNolan, said: "NK cells have huge
OL,13,Fpotential as off-the-shelf therapies,
OL,14,Fand this trial takes us one step
OL,15,Fcloser to a wider application of
OL,16,Fengineered NK cells in the targeted
OL,17,Ftreatment of cancers.
OL,26,@tD@NOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30518
SC,0018
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785458898
OL,3,CWoman becomes first to receive
OL,4,Cpioneering new cancer therapy
OL,6,F"At Anthony Nolan we have long seen
OL,7,Fthe potential of cellular therapies
OL,8,Flike this to transform the lives of
OL,9,Fpatients with blood cancer.
OL,11,F"Today's research represents exciting
OL,12,Fprogress for patients with solid
OL,13,Ftumours to benefit from these
OL,14,Fpromising therapies."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUvD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G18/18
